"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43289,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山别胡提学还至九江作","author":"陈献章","text":"峡山飞出两三航，满载离愁下九江。\n夜泊孤舟不能寐，自烧银烛到秋江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43290,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画兰","author":"陈献章","text":"谁将水墨写横披，竹石荆兰也自宜。\n记得湘潭秋雨后，清香犹带楚臣悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43291,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜孙读书","author":"陈献章","text":"閒看溪水绕橙根，自握刀锄斸小园。\n日午课诗孙渐长，上堂誇与阿婆言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43292,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉文笔","author":"陈献章","text":"丈人日暮看芙蓉，湘水西来第几峰。\n兔颖刺天无属我，今为松桂主人公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43293,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄李子长","author":"陈献章","text":"能将玄酒注金卮，混沌谁教更凿之。\n我借元初溟滓好，为君惊喜为君悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43294,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孔雀图","author":"陈献章","text":"儿女心情未遣知，白头笑赋雀屏诗。\n可能乳得西周凤，来寿君王亿万期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43295,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蒲石画","author":"陈献章","text":"一石青青荫几蒲，半篙烟水欠模糊。\n江门有个丹青手，也把江门画作图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43296,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中送客江上偶成","author":"陈献章","text":"细雨江边送画桡，肩舆如梦看春潮。\n不知此处谁分付，笑倚南风酒未消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43297,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵呈长官赠邹汝愚","author":"陈献章","text":"江门还我自由仙，七洞天西小洞天。\n南去北来船过尽，无人肯住钓台前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43298,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再韵呈吴献臣","author":"陈献章","text":"双凫海上果谁仙，伫看飞腾上九天。\n为问南迁邹吏目，几时归去玉皇前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43299,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"候方伯刘东山先生至 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"客从天柱得琅函，来试丹砂岭以南。\n有个道人眠不起，洞门深锁白龙庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43300,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"候方伯刘东山先生至 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"易传遗书共此函，偶拈一事问河南。\n数千里外涪州梦，透到龙门何处庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43301,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e3